## Proposed Modules & API Endpoints

### 1. `common` (Shared Kernel)
- **Base Entities & Auditing**: `BaseEntity` (`id`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `createdBy`, `updatedBy`).
- **Response Wrappers**: `ApiResponse<T>`, `PageResponse<T>`, `ErrorResponse`.
- **Global Exception Handling**: `@RestControllerAdvice` handling validation errors, resource not found, unauthorized, and business exceptions.
- **OpenAPI Configuration**: Custom OpenAPI 3.0 bean with JWT Bearer security scheme.
- **CORS Configuration**: Open for `http://localhost:4200` with full REST verbs.

### 2. `iam` (Identity & Access Management)
- **Domain**: `UserAccount`, `Role` (`SUPER_ADMIN`, `COMPANY_ADMIN`, `HR_MANAGER`, `EMPLOYEE`), `UserPrincipal`.
- **Services**: `AuthenticationService`, `JwtTokenProvider`, `CustomUserDetailsService`.
- **Endpoints**:
  - `POST /api/v1/auth/login` (Returns JWT token, user info, role permissions)
  - `POST /api/v1/auth/register` (Account creation)
  - `POST /api/v1/auth/refresh` (Refresh access token)
  - `GET /api/v1/auth/me` (Current authenticated user profile)
  - `POST /api/v1/auth/change-password`

### 3. `organization` (Company, Departments & Designations)
- **Domain**: `CompanyProfile`, `Department`, `Designation`.
- **Endpoints**:
  - `GET /api/v1/companies`, `GET /api/v1/companies/{id}`, `POST /api/v1/companies`, `PUT /api/v1/companies/{id}`
  - `GET /api/v1/departments`, `POST /api/v1/departments`, `PUT /api/v1/departments/{id}`, `DELETE /api/v1/departments/{id}`
  - `GET /api/v1/designations`, `POST /api/v1/designations`, `PUT /api/v1/designations/{id}`
- **Public API**: `OrganizationPublicService` for department and designation validation.

### 4. `employee` (Core Employee Management & Lifecycle)
- **Domain**: `Employee`, `Address`, `EmergencyContact`, `BankDetails`, `EmploymentType`, `EmployeeStatus`.
- **Endpoints**:
  - `GET /api/v1/employees` (Paginated, filtered by department, status, search query)
  - `GET /api/v1/employees/{id}` (Detailed profile)
  - `POST /api/v1/employees` (Onboard employee)
  - `PUT /api/v1/employees/{id}` (Update personal & job details)
  - `PATCH /api/v1/employees/{id}/status` (Status transition)
  - `GET /api/v1/employees/stats` (Department distribution, status breakdown)
- **Events Published**: `EmployeeOnboardedEvent`, `EmployeeStatusChangedEvent`, `EmployeeSalaryUpdatedEvent`.
- **Events Listened**: `@ApplicationModuleListener` for `CandidateHiredEvent`.

### 5. `attendance` (Time Tracking & Daily Logs)
- **Domain**: `AttendanceRecord`, `AttendanceStatus` (`Present`, `Late`, `Half Day`, `Absent`, `On Leave`, `Holiday`).
- **Endpoints**:
  - `POST /api/v1/attendance/punch-in`
  - `POST /api/v1/attendance/punch-out`
  - `GET /api/v1/attendance/today-status` (Current clock status & elapsed timer)
  - `GET /api/v1/attendance/records` (Date range, employee filter)
  - `GET /api/v1/attendance/stats` (Average working hours, on-time %, late marks)
- **Events Listened**: `@ApplicationModuleListener` for `LeaveApprovedEvent` (auto-marks attendance as `ON_LEAVE`).

### 6. `leave` (Leave Balances & Workflow Approval)
- **Domain**: `LeaveRequest`, `LeaveBalance`, `LeaveType`, `Holiday`, `LeaveStatus` (`Pending`, `Approved`, `Rejected`, `Cancelled`).
- **Endpoints**:
  - `GET /api/v1/leaves/balances/{employeeId}` (Casual, Sick, Paid, Maternity balances)
  - `POST /api/v1/leaves/apply` (Submit leave application)
  - `GET /api/v1/leaves/requests` (Filter by status, employee, date)
  - `PATCH /api/v1/leaves/requests/{id}/approve` (Manager approval, updates balance & publishes event)
  - `PATCH /api/v1/leaves/requests/{id}/reject`
  - `GET /api/v1/leaves/holidays`
- **Events Published**: `LeaveAppliedEvent`, `LeaveApprovedEvent`, `LeaveRejectedEvent`.
- **Events Listened**: `@ApplicationModuleListener` for `EmployeeOnboardedEvent` (allocates initial leave quota).

### 7. `payroll` (Salary Processing & Payslips)
- **Domain**: `SalaryStructure`, `Payslip`, `PayrollRun`, `PaymentStatus` (`Paid`, `Processing`, `Pending`).
- **Earnings & Deductions**: Basic, HRA, Special Allowance, PF, Professional Tax, TDS, Health Insurance, LOP deduction calculation.
- **Endpoints**:
  - `POST /api/v1/payroll/generate-monthly` (Generates payslips for month based on attendance & leaves)
  - `GET /api/v1/payroll/payslips` (Filtered by month, employee)
  - `GET /api/v1/payroll/payslips/{id}` (Detailed payslip breakdown)
  - `PATCH /api/v1/payroll/payslips/{id}/pay` (Mark as paid)
  - `GET /api/v1/payroll/summary` (Total Gross, Net Pay, Deductions)
- **Events Published**: `PayrollProcessedEvent`, `PayslipGeneratedEvent`.

### 8. `recruitment` (ATS & Candidate Pipeline)
- **Domain**: `JobPosting`, `Candidate`, `JobStatus`, `CandidateStage` (`Applied`, `Screening`, `Interview`, `Offered`, `Hired`, `Rejected`).
- **Endpoints**:
  - `GET /api/v1/recruitment/jobs`, `POST /api/v1/recruitment/jobs`, `PUT /api/v1/recruitment/jobs/{id}`
  - `GET /api/v1/recruitment/candidates`, `POST /api/v1/recruitment/candidates`
  - `PATCH /api/v1/recruitment/candidates/{id}/stage` (Pipeline stage transition; when `HIRED`, publishes `CandidateHiredEvent`!)
- **Events Published**: `CandidateHiredEvent`.

### 9. `performance` (Goals & Appraisals)
- **Domain**: `Goal`, `AppraisalReview`, `GoalPriority`, `GoalStatus`, `ReviewStatus`.
- **Endpoints**:
  - `GET /api/v1/performance/goals`, `POST /api/v1/performance/goals`, `PATCH /api/v1/performance/goals/{id}/progress`
  - `GET /api/v1/performance/reviews`, `POST /api/v1/performance/reviews`

### 10. `notification` (Announcements & In-App Alerts)
- **Domain**: `Announcement`, `NotificationLog`.
- **Endpoints**:
  - `GET /api/v1/notifications/announcements`, `POST /api/v1/notifications/announcements`
  - `GET /api/v1/notifications/my-notifications`, `PATCH /api/v1/notifications/{id}/read`
- **Events Listened**: `@ApplicationModuleListener` across events from Employee, Leave, Payroll, Recruitment.

